{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/410f6f209e7658d02fbef56666230ecc.avif?t=1773319723\" width=600 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Node</strong> is a <strong>third-person stealth hacking game</strong> where every system is both a threat and an opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a <strong>freelance hacker</strong> infiltrating <strong>high-security corporate facilities</strong>, using cunning, precision, and a <strong>versatile drone</strong> to outsmart advanced surveillance. \u00a0<strong>Observe</strong>, <strong>plan</strong>, and <strong>execute</strong> your infiltrations through a network of interconnected systems, where creativity is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/35460449d1b8ba0e2895291cc49735f0.avif?t=1773319723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras_big/35460449d1b8ba0e2895291cc49735f0.webp?t=1773319723 width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link and rewire devices to open new paths, create distractions, and turn the corporation\u2019s defenses against itself. Hack cameras, lights, doors, and even enemy weapons to reshape each mission to fit your strategy. Every encounter is a puzzle and every solution, uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/76a4c16ec43750485da0e86fb917ff60.poster.avif?t=1773319723\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/76a4c16ec43750485da0e86fb917ff60.webm?t=1773319723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/76a4c16ec43750485da0e86fb917ff60.mp4?t=1773319723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/1dfbee47bf9e77ed82c4344f8a11fe6c.avif?t=1773319723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras_big/1dfbee47bf9e77ed82c4344f8a11fe6c.webp?t=1773319723 width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through shadows, avoid detection, and manipulate the environment to stay one step ahead of corporate patrols. Control lights to expand the darkness, create safe paths, or plunge entire areas into shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/4405a337c8886b80fa1d27e98b81fa3c.poster.avif?t=1773319723\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/4405a337c8886b80fa1d27e98b81fa3c.webm?t=1773319723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/4405a337c8886b80fa1d27e98b81fa3c.mp4?t=1773319723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/f9330192b419cb51513202a301af2956.avif?t=1773319723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras_big/f9330192b419cb51513202a301af2956.webp?t=1773319723 width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wrong move can set the entire system against you alarms blaring, patrols converging, defenses activating. When plans collapse, you\u2019ll need to think fast, adapt on the fly, and use the chaos to your advantage. Every failure reveals new insights, every setback a chance to find unconventional paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/9a316a912b6b1098a3af1a22be1eed80.poster.avif?t=1773319723\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/9a316a912b6b1098a3af1a22be1eed80.webm?t=1773319723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/9a316a912b6b1098a3af1a22be1eed80.mp4?t=1773319723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/3c4bfd18efeb97c63bbb6db3baa5cb73.avif?t=1773319723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras_big/3c4bfd18efeb97c63bbb6db3baa5cb73.webp?t=1773319723 width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept contracts, gather intel, and negotiate with clients through your secure interface. The world\u2019s most dangerous jobs, all managed remotely. Build your reputation in the shadows and uncover the hidden agendas behind every contract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/cbe839b0a4c91ff55aab4f511aacf8c2.avif?t=1773319723\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060200?t=1773319723","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/0ee7aa97d123b75d90b17629f6b88aafde926f82/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773319723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/16cf2c6ce6369f0a51b51f9ba697575a4fa25d31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773319723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/16cf2c6ce6369f0a51b51f9ba697575a4fa25d31/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773319723","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060200/extras/410f6f